mit as on </span></b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>01/01/2026</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age :<strong> 20 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>33 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per Railway RRB Section Controller CEN 04/2025 Recruitment Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Railway RRB Section Controller Recruitment 2025: <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Vacancy Details </span></b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Total : 368 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Railway RRB Section Controller Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Railway RRB Section Controller Post</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">368 Post</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Railway RRB Section Controller Exam 2025: <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Category Wise Vacancy Details</span></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><b>General</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"77\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>EWS</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>OBC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"55\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>SC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"59\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>ST</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">Railway RRB Section Controller</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">174</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"77\">24</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"76\">80</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"55\">56</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"59\">34</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"73\"><strong>368</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill Railway RRB Section Controller Recruitment Online Form 2025</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Railway RRB Section Controller Recruitment for Various Post Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>15/09/2025 to 14/10/2025</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Railway RRB Section Controller Recruitment 2025.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</